0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></=
div></div></h2><p><span>Let=E2=80=99s start with Qwen3-Next, which replaced=
 the regular attention mechanism by a </span><a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/a=
bs/2412.06464">Gated DeltaNet</a><span> + </span><a href=3D"https://arxiv.o=
rg/abs/2505.06708">Gated Attention</a><span> hybrid, which helps enable the=
 native 262k token context length in terms of memory usage (the previous 23=
5B-A22B model model supported 32k natively, and 131k with </span><a href=3D=
"https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.00071">YaRN</a><span> scaling.)</span></p><p>Th=
