his allows the model to scale up or down certain features dynamically. The =
Qwen3-Next developers </span><a href=3D"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=3D4074cca80=
393150c248e508aa62983f9cb7d27cd&amp;from=3Dresearch.latest-advancements-lis=
t">state</a><span> that this helps with training stability:</span></p><bloc=
kquote><p>[...] the attention output gating mechanism helps eliminate issue=
s like Attention Sink and Massive Activation, ensuring numerical stability =
across the model.</p></blockquote><p><span>In short, gated attention modula=
tes the </span><em>output</em><span> of standard attention. In the next sec=
tion, we discuss Gated DeltaNet, which replaces the attention mechanism its=
