e of their key strengths, though. And the problem with pure parallel decodi=
ng can be illustrated with an excellent example from the recent ParallelBen=
ch: Understanding the Trade-offs of </span><a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/abs=
/2510.04767">Parallel Decoding in Diffusion LLMs</a><span> paper.</span></p=
