cement learning agents. (But the term or concept itself essentially just re=
fers to modeling a concept of a world or environment, so it goes back to re=
inforcement learning and robotics research in the 1980s.)</span></p><p><spa=
n>To be honest, I didn=E2=80=99t have the new interpretation of world model=
s on my radar until Yann LeCun=E2=80=99s 2022 article </span><a href=3D"htt=
ps://openreview.net/pdf?id=3DBZ5a1r-kVsf">A Path Towards Autonomous Machine=
